    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χά̆ρ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grace, favour,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.102
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				84
			</span></i> H.; esp. in <i>NT, gift of God's grace,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				12.4
			</span></i>, al.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψώνια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				6.23
			</span></i>; later, generally, <i>favour bestowed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1044.4
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">iv A. D.</span>).</div>
